{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_047_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "a8e2263bfa6ef639da8d28eeb1b84d977c8422bd5a3d95ee846873fa606ddff0", "ja": "この前の白石さんの公演、\nとてもよかったわね。\n想いがどんどん広がっていって…。", "zh": "白石前阵子的公演真的很棒呢。\n能感受到她的心意\n连绵不绝地扩散出去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_047_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "71c4630bf6ac4bf956387b34632b205fcf9253a064622a9d3eebbdd0b12c80f2", "ja": "むー。\n千早さん、その前に\nミキの公演のことは？", "zh": "唔～千早，\n在称赞䌷之前，\n美希的公演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
